{"title":"Counting number","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p>The <b>counting numbers</b> are just another name for the <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Positive_integer\" title=\"Positive integer\">positive integers</a>. This name is based on the fact that we count numbers of objects using positive integers (for example, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/d/7cde695f2e4542fd01f860a89189f47a27143b66.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> pencils).\nThese are just the numbers in the set of {1,2,3,4,..}\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Classification_Of_Counting_Numbers\">Classification Of Counting Numbers</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Counting_number&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Classification Of Counting Numbers\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/js-Dx3Mf85g\">https://youtu.be/js-Dx3Mf85g</a>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Counting_number&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Natural_number\" title=\"Natural number\">Natural number</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Integer\" title=\"Integer\">Integer</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Combinatorics\" title=\"Combinatorics\">Combinatorics</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Number_line\" title=\"Number line\">Number line</a></li></ul>\n<p><i>This article is a stub.  Help us out by <span class=\"plainlinks\"><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/index.php?title=Counting_number&amp;action=edit\">expanding it</a></span>.</i>\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261018081744\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.011 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.016 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 18/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 286/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 4/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 171/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    6.233      1 Template:Stub\n100.00%    6.233      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:1789:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261018081744 and revision id 190060. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}